␀A€î°Ë␀°)" Vim syntax file
" Language:             pinfo(1) configuration file
" Previous Maintainer:  Nikolai Weibull <now@bitwi.se>
" Latest Revision:      2007-06-17

if exists("b:current_syntax")
  finish
