␀A€¾ØË␀Ïˆ" Vim syntax file
" Language:             readline(3) configuration file
" Maintainer:           Daniel Moch <daniel@danielmoch.com>
" Previous Maintainer:  Nikolai Weibull <now@bitwi.se>
