" Last Change:         2024 Jun 21
" Maintainer:          Evan Hanson <evhan@foldling.org>
" Previous Maintainer: Sergey Khorev <sergey.khorev@gmail.com>
" Repository:          https://git.foldling.org/vim-scheme.git
